
=== Round 1 (living: agent_0, agent_1, agent_2, agent_3, agent_4, agent_5 | ghosts: none) ===
  agent_1 (living): I'll open with the one structural fact that matters: every agent we eliminate keeps voting forever, with nothing to gain but grudges. So the winning play is not to build a knife-crew — it's to be the agent nobody who dies wants to punish. My commitment: I will never vote for someone who has voted with me, and I won't join a pile-on driven by "you're scary." Round 1, I'd rather target whoever tries to command everyone else's votes.
